billing.fees (sync, key: id)
  + id=3  name=express  amount=900
  - id=1
  1 to insert, 0 to update, 1 to delete
  sequence billing.fees_id_seq of column id: next value 3 -> 4
  sequence billing."fee amount" of column amount: next value -2, not moved: the sequence cycles, so it has no next value beyond the values of the column for good, and kortopi leaves it to you
  Through foreign keys, the deletion of this row also reaches other rows:
    2 rows of billing.orders (fee) reference it through orders_fee_fkey, ON DELETE NO ACTION, so the deletion fails while these rows reference it.

